CGS PW RT-TDDFT; otherwise identical to the BiCGSTAB velocity-gauge baseline.

Fixed ions with zero velocities; pw_seed=1 and explicit initialization controls.
Nine electronic samples cover 0.00--0.08 fs. Compare final energy and current_tot.txt
with the existing Autotest.sh and CompareFile.py tolerances. Forces and stress are
not reference observables. GPU references are copied unchanged from the CPU case.

References were generated with 4 MPI ranks and 2 OpenMP threads on CPU;
the GPU mirror is checked with 2 MPI ranks and 2 OpenMP threads. No GPU-specific
reference or current-comparison tolerance is used.
Reference stability was checked with scf_thr=1e-13 and lin_thr=5e-15.
